 "text": "-->\nHord Elevator | Bucyrus, OH | Edison, OH\ntop of page\nYOUR CORN FEEDS THE LOCAL ECONOMY\nHome: Welcome\nANNOUNCEMENTS\n​\nPlease consider bringing us corn samples to test for vomitoxin. Ideally, we would like at least 3-4 ears of black layered corn from each field. Label samples by field, and if you’d like to include variety or fungicide information, that information can be helpful as well.\n​\nBucyrus is CONTRACT ONLY on FALL corn. New contracts can be made for December forward. Edison can still accept additional fall bushels ​\n​\n2026 DP Rates\nCorn: 10 cents per month until 12/31/26 then 8 cents per month, prorated daily. No charge if priced within 7 days.\nSoybeans: 15 cents per month until 12/31/26 then 8 cents per month, prorated daily. No charge if priced within 7 days.\nAll DP must be priced by 9/30/2027\n​\nVomitoxin limits: Corn testing over 4.0 PPM is subject to rejection. Each producer is permitted 1 grace load per week up to 5.5 PPM\nCASH BIDS\nSign up here to receive cash bid TEXTS\nSign up here to receive cash bid EMAILS\nUNLOAD HOURS\nBUCYRUS\nMonday 10/12: 7: 30AM - 7:00PM\nTuesday 10/13: 7: 30AM - 4:30PM\nWednesday 10/14: 7:30AM - 5:00PM\nThursday 10/15: 7:30AM - 7:00PM\nFriday 10/16: 7:30AM - 4:30PM\nSaturday 10/17: CLOSED ​\n​\nBucyrus\nMonday - Friday: 7:30am - 4:30pm\n​\nEdison Branch\nCall Ahead: 740-244-6904\nEDISON BRANCH\nMonday 10/12: 7: 30AM - 6:00PM\nTuesday 10/13: 7: 30AM - 7:00PM\nWednesday 10/14: 7:30AM - 5:00PM\nThursday 10/15: 7:30AM - 6:00PM\nFriday 10/16: 7:30AM - 2:00PM\nSaturday 10/17: CLOSED\n​\nDISCOUNT SCHEDULES\nCorn\nSoybeans\nMEET THE GRAIN TEAM\nKaylee Blankenship\nChristina Hazlett\nKatelyn Long\nHome: Discount Schedules\nCONTACT US\nBUCYRUS ELEVATOR\n910 OH-98\nBUCYRUS, OH 44820\nEDISON ELEVATOR\n6775 TOWNSHIP RD 66\nEDISON, OH 43320\nPHONE: (419) 562-1198\nAFTER HOURS BIDLINE: (419) 561-4725\n©2024 by Hord Elevator\nbottom of page",
